                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova. Kuciindi cacoolwe ndakuvwiila, amubuzuba bwalufutuko ndakugwasya. Ndakubamba, ndakupa kuti ube cizuminano cabantu, kuti ukabusye nyika akubakonya inkono zisaalidwe, ",
