        {
          "text": "ukaambile baange kuti, Amuzwe, abaabo bali mumudima ukabaambile kuti, Amuboneke. Bayoocela munzila zyoonse; macelelo aabo ayooba atala lyazilundu zyoonse zikukwidwe muuwo. ",
          "type": "text",
