        {
          "text": "Tabakooyoofwa inzala nikuba kufwa nyota, Inkasaalo tiikooyoobauma, niliba izuba. Nkaambo oyo uubafwida luzyalo uyoobazulwida, ulabeenzya kumbali lyatusensa twamaanzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njoosandula zilundu zyangu kuti ziindike, amigwagwa yoonse iyoosumpulwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amubone! Bamwi bayoozwa kule, bamwi bayoozwa kunyika akumbo, abamwi bayoozwa kucisi ca-Sinimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amwiimbe nomajulu, sekelela O nyika. Amutalike kwiimba numalundu. Nkaambo Jehova waumbulizya bantu bakwe, abapengede bakwe wabafwida luzyalo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.13"
            ]
          }
        }
