                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela bami bayooba basimalelo bako, abanamalelo babo bayooba basikunyonsya bako. Bayoomukotamina cakuvundama ansi akumyankuta itombe lyakumaulu aako, Lino muyooziba kuti ndime Jehova. Boonse balangila ndime tabakooyoofwa insoni.",
