        },
        {
          "text": "Ncobeni mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova, Bazike mbaatolede singuzu bayoolubululwa, alunyanzyo lwamukali luyoovunwa. Njoolwisya abo bakulwisya, nkabela njoofutula bana bako. ",
          "type": "text",
