        {
          "text": "Abaabo bakupenzya njoobalisya nyama yabo beni, nkabela bayookolwa bulowa bwabo mbuli muntu mbwakoledwe imbote, Lino bantu boonse bayooziba kuti mebo nde-Jehova ndime mufutuli wako amunununi wako, Singuzu wa-Jakobo.",
